  "contract": "Repeats of the result that finished an activity attempt (published Server 2.11.7 ActivityTaskController with Workflow 2.15.7), over raw worker HTTP on protocol 1.20 in a fresh namespace. After a completion or a non-retryable failure finishes the attempt, the same result again, a different result, the other route, and the same result after the workflow consumed it are each refused 409 stale_attempt, recorded false, with nothing added to history. A repeated completion's receipt names the lease owner and the attempt, activity and task statuses, which published SDKs read as their own committed completion; a repeated failure's receipt carries none of them. IDs are labels. Embedded applications have no worker protocol.",
